# strings-shapes.list — starter leak-shape roster for check-binary-strings.
# gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-binary-strings. One POSIX ERE per line, matched against
# each printable string a named build output ships; '#' comments and blank lines
# are ignored, and a '# rule: <ID>' line names the rule id of every shape after it.
# Copy to your gates dir as strings-shapes.list and name your shipped outputs in
# GATE_SDK_STRINGS_FILES; delete a shape your binaries carry by design.

# rule: HOME-PATH
/(home|root|Users)/

# rule: REGISTRY-PATH
\.cargo/registry/

# rule: URL
[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9+.-]*://
